# ========================================
# 🔥 IMPORTANT: STRIPE SETUP REQUIRED!
# ========================================
# 
# Your current Stripe keys are placeholders!
# Follow these steps to get real keys:
#
# 1. Go to https://stripe.com and create an account
# 2. Visit https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys
# 3. Copy your TEST keys (for development):
#    - Secret key (starts with sk_test_)
#    - Publishable key (starts with pk_test_)
# 
# 4. Set up webhooks at https://dashboard.stripe.com/webhooks
#    - Endpoint URL: http://localhost:5000/api/payments/webhook
#    - Select these events:
#      * payment_intent.succeeded
#      * payment_intent.payment_failed  
#      * payment_intent.canceled
#      * charge.dispute.created
#    - Copy the webhook signing secret (starts with whsec_)
#
# 5. Replace the placeholder values above with your real keys
#
# ⚠️  Without real Stripe keys, payments will fail!
# ========================================